    "detailed_description": "Bounce to the beat of different music genres, and save your missing mushroom friends!<br><br>Mushroom Musical is a colorful platformer game, with two game modes: adventure and challenge. <br>In adventure mode, you are searching for your mushroom friends through forests, fields, oceans and factories. <br>The better you are in adventure mode, the more skins and adventure/challenge levels you unlock.<br>Each adventure level has its own music genre. Examples of level names: Jellyfish Jazz, Bumblebee Blues.<br>The challenge levels is where you can test yourself to see for how long you can avoid enemies. <br>If you get good at it, it\u00b4s also a way to unlock skins.<br>There are 3 worlds, 9 adventure levels, 1 boss level, and 3 challenge levels.<br><br>This game is also available on android.<br><br>Wishlist the next game in the same genre: Balls &amp; Beats!<br>",
    "about_the_game": "Bounce to the beat of different music genres, and save your missing mushroom friends!<br><br>Mushroom Musical is a colorful platformer game, with two game modes: adventure and challenge. <br>In adventure mode, you are searching for your mushroom friends through forests, fields, oceans and factories. <br>The better you are in adventure mode, the more skins and adventure/challenge levels you unlock.<br>Each adventure level has its own music genre. Examples of level names: Jellyfish Jazz, Bumblebee Blues.<br>The challenge levels is where you can test yourself to see for how long you can avoid enemies. <br>If you get good at it, it\u00b4s also a way to unlock skins.<br>There are 3 worlds, 9 adventure levels, 1 boss level, and 3 challenge levels.<br><br>This game is also available on android.<br><br>Wishlist the next game in the same genre: Balls &amp; Beats!<br>",
